Appendix B. Formal Type-1 Binding Game

Experiment \mathbf{Exp}^{\mathrm{bind}}_{\mathcal{A}}(\lambda,\rho).

1. The challenger initializes honest issuer, platform, network, and token-service state, with \delta_c^{\mathrm{data}}=\delta_c^{\mathrm{factor}}=0 for all c\in\mathcal{C}.
2. \mathcal{A} receives oracle access to:
